              "criteria": {
                "true": "The message is about a transfer of funds between accounts that is pending, late, failed, duplicated, misdirected, or otherwise problematic or questioned by the customer. Statements implying a transfer problem count (e.g. 'my money hasn't shown up', 'I sent money to the wrong person', 'the transfer didn't go through').",
                "false": "The message is about something else entirely, such as card activation or delivery, PIN/password changes, ATM withdrawals or cash dispense errors, exchange rates on card purchases, account closure, card acceptance, verification of identity, or general card questions."
